# Raw screen recordings (demo.gif in the repo root is the actual README asset --
# GitHub only renders GIFs inline in README.md, never MP4/MKV, so a raw video
# committed here would just be dead weight: no inline playback, permanent repo
# bloat, and it'd trip GitHub's 100MB hard push limit on longer recordings.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.webm

